# ===========================================
# CyberWorld Builders Environment Variables
# ===========================================
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values
#
# NOTE (2026-09-05): the database, chat widget, lead capture and
# behavior-tracking subsystems were removed. The site is now a static
# Next.js blog + marketing page. Only the vars below remain in use.

